{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Voice Agent Project\n## LiveKit + Gemini Live\n\n**What I Built:** A voice-powered AI assistant that talks to users in real-time, like a human support agent.","x":-400,"y":-800,"width":800,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"simple-flow","type":"text","text":"## Simple Flow\n\n```\n👤 User speaks\n    ↓\n📡 LiveKit captures audio\n    ↓\n🧠 Gemini understands & responds\n    ↓\n📡 LiveKit sends voice back\n    ↓\n🔊 User hears response\n```\n\n**All in real-time!** (~1-2 seconds total)","x":20,"y":-520,"width":380,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"problem","type":"text","text":"##  The Problem I Solved\n\n**Challenge:** How do you build a voice assistant that:\n- Talks naturally (like a human)\n- Works in real-time (no delays)\n- Handles multiple users at once\n- Doesn't cost a fortune\n\n**Solution:** Combine LiveKit (handles connections) + Gemini (handles thinking & talking)","x":-400,"y":-520,"width":380,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"livekit-role","type":"text","text":"##  LiveKit = The Plumbing\n\n**What it does:**\n- Captures audio from user's microphone\n- Streams it to Gemini\n- Sends responses back to user's speaker\n- Manages connections (WebRTC)\n- Handles multiple users in \"rooms\"\n\n**Think of it as:** The delivery system (like roads for cars)","x":-680,"y":0,"width":360,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gemini-role","type":"text","text":"##  Gemini = The Brain\n\n**What it does:**\n1. **Speech-to-Text (STT)** - Hears what you said\n2. **Language Model (LLM)** - Understands & decides response\n3. **Text-to-Speech (TTS)** - Speaks the response\n\n**Model:** `gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview`\n\n**Think of it as:** The smart assistant that actually understands you","x":-260,"y":0,"width":360,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"vad","type":"text","text":"##  Silero VAD = The Listener\n\n**What it does:**\n- Detects when you START speaking\n- Detects when you STOP speaking\n- Filters out background noise\n\n**Why needed:**\nWithout it, the agent wouldn't know when to listen!\n\n**Think of it as:** The \"mute/unmute\" button, but automatic","x":140,"y":0,"width":360,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"turn-detection","type":"text","text":"## 🔄 Semantic Turn Detection\n\n**Problem:** If you pause mid-sentence, VAD thinks you stopped!\n\n**Solution:** Semantic turn detection understands context:\n- \"I need to book a...\" (pausing) ❌ DON'T interrupt!\n- \"I need to book a flight.\" (done) ✅ Agent can respond!\n\n**Impact:** ~20ms extra wait, but much smarter conversations","x":580,"y":0,"width":360,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"troubleshooting","type":"text","text":"## 🔧 Troubleshooting Guide\n\n| Problem | Fix Where |\n|---------|----------|\n| Agent too slow | Gemini config |\n| Choppy audio | LiveKit settings |\n| Bad interruptions | Silero VAD tuning |\n| Agent talks too long | LiveKit `aec_warmup_duration` |\n| Uses too many tokens | Shorten Gemini instructions |\n| Voice quality | Change Gemini voice (Puck/Kore/Aoede) |","x":760,"y":460,"width":440,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cost-analysis","type":"text","text":"## 💰 Cost Analysis\n\n**Running 24/7:**\n- LiveKit server: ₹360/day\n- Gemini API: ₹1/day\n- **Total:** ₹10,800/month\n\n**Hybrid Model (Smart!):**\n- Human agent (9 AM - 6 PM): ₹10,000/month\n- Voice agent (6 PM - 9 AM + Sundays): ₹6,840/month\n- **Total:** ₹17,000/month\n\n**vs Traditional IVR:** More natural, flexible, and cost-effective!","x":-640,"y":480,"width":560,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"architecture","type":"text","text":"## 🏗️ Technical Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────┐\n│   Browser   │ (User)\n│   WebRTC    │\n└──────┬──────┘\n       │\n┌──────▼──────┐\n│  LiveKit    │ (Transport Layer)\n│   Server    │\n└──────┬──────┘\n       │\n┌──────▼──────┐\n│ Silero VAD  │ (Speech Detection)\n└──────┬──────┘\n       │\n┌──────▼──────┐\n│   Gemini    │ (AI Brain)\n│ 3.1 Flash   │\n│  Live API   │\n└─────────────┘\n```","x":-920,"y":920,"width":420,"height":560,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"why-both","type":"text","text":"## 🤷 Why Do I Need Both?\n\n**Why not just Gemini?**\n- Gemini doesn't handle WebRTC\n- No multi-user room management\n- No connection management\n\n**Why not just LiveKit?**\n- LiveKit doesn't understand speech\n- It's just transport, not intelligence\n\n**Together:** LiveKit moves audio, Gemini processes it. Perfect team!","x":800,"y":920,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tools-integration","type":"text","text":"## 🛠️ Tools & Actions\n\n**The agent can DO things:**\n- Search databases\n- Book appointments\n- Check order status\n- Process payments\n\n**How:** Using `@function_tool()` decorator\n\n**Best Practice:**\n- Keep tools fast (<2 seconds)\n- Say \"Let me check...\" for long tasks\n- Block interruptions for critical actions (like payments)","x":40,"y":480,"width":480,"height":440,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"use-cases","type":"text","text":"## 💼 What Can This Be Used For?\n\n✅ **Customer Support** - 24/7 automated helpdesk\n✅ **Appointment Booking** - Schedule calls/meetings\n✅ **Order Status** - Check delivery, track orders\n✅ **FAQ Answering** - Common questions\n✅ **Language Practice** - Conversation partner\n✅ **Accessibility** - Voice interface for apps\n✅ **Lead Qualification** - Initial sales calls","x":-480,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"next-steps","type":"text","text":"## 🚀 What's Next?\n\n**Improvements I Can Make:**\n\n1. Add more function tools (database, CRM, etc.)\n2. Fine-tune interruption handling\n3. Optimize latency (<1 second response)\n4. Add conversation memory/context\n5. Multi-language support\n6. Deploy to production (Docker + Cloud)\n7. Add analytics dashboard\n8. Test with real users","x":80,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"key-features","type":"text","text":"## ⭐ Key Features I Built\n\n1. **Real-time Conversations** - Natural back-and-forth\n2. **Smart Interruptions** - Knows when to listen vs when to wait\n3. **Function Calling** - Can actually DO things, not just talk\n4. **Multi-user Support** - Multiple people can use it at once\n5. **Cost Optimized** - Hybrid human/AI model saves money\n6. **Language Aware** - Handles pauses in natural speech","x":-360,"y":1000,"width":800,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"learning-resources","type":"text","text":"## 📚 Resources I Used\n\n- [LiveKit Docs](https://docs.livekit.io/intro/overview/)\n- [Master Voice AI Agents Course](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n-hCOsVQQgA)\n- Gemini Live API Documentation\n- Silero VAD Library\n\n**Key Topics Learned:**\n- WebRTC fundamentals\n- Voice Activity Detection (VAD)\n- Semantic turn detection\n- Function calling in voice agents\n- Real-time streaming protocols","x":800,"y":1430,"width":440,"height":300,"color":"6"}
	],
